installer/nsis/build-profile.json
# The fetched VC++ redistributable. ~25 MB, published by Microsoft, and it changes when they revise it -- so it is
# fetched and verified by `npm run release:prerequisite` rather than committed. The digest travels in
# build-profile.json, which IS in the tree, so a build can always be traced back to the exact binary it carries.
installer/cache/

# Compiled installer output. A build artefact, never a source file: it is produced by `npm run build` (or, for the
# harness, by `npm run installer:compile`) and would go stale in the tree the moment the script changed.
*.exe
